.pytest_cache/

# cosmic-ray sessions, written into the root by the commands CONTRIBUTING.md
# gives: one row per mutant, so a finished sighash session is 727 verdicts
# and megabytes of them. What is worth keeping is uploaded by the mutation
# workflow as an artifact, where it expires; a session committed here would
# be a snapshot of a suite that has moved on
*.sqlite
